WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.258 --> 00:00:02.424
- Every now and then I'll take
a hit of whatever you've got.

00:00:02.424 --> 00:00:05.848
I don't care if it's a
upper or downer or whatever.

00:00:05.848 --> 00:00:08.920
I just like to, you know, smoke
a joint every now and then.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.550
(upbeat music)

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:12.767
Well, hey there.

00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:14.388
Look, it's Willie.

00:00:14.388 --> 00:00:16.718
- [Voiceover] In Austin,
Texas, there's a massive statue

00:00:16.718 --> 00:00:19.715
immortalizing the city's
most-celebrated resident.

00:00:19.715 --> 00:00:22.379
Upon the sculpture's
installation, Willie said,

00:00:22.379 --> 00:00:25.019
"I'll be stoned 1,000 years."

00:00:25.019 --> 00:00:28.371
Is it funny to you how famous
you've become for the pot?

00:00:28.371 --> 00:00:29.854
- Yeah, it's hilarious.

00:00:29.854 --> 00:00:32.687
(laughing)

00:00:32.687 --> 00:00:33.635
It is.

00:00:33.635 --> 00:00:35.726
Well, you know, I spent
enough time in jail,

00:00:35.726 --> 00:00:38.744
and I feel like I've bought enough of it,

00:00:38.744 --> 00:00:42.232
so I feel like I could be
able to sell some back.

00:00:42.232 --> 00:00:43.363
- [Voiceover] So he is.

00:00:43.363 --> 00:00:45.976
Willie's planning to launch
his own brand of marijuana

00:00:45.976 --> 00:00:48.131
called Willie's Reserve.

00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:49.347
- Well, I don't know how cool it is,

00:00:49.347 --> 00:00:51.044
but I think it's the right thing to do,

00:00:51.044 --> 00:00:52.642
you know, if you believe in it.

00:00:52.642 --> 00:00:54.338
In the past few years,

00:00:54.338 --> 00:00:56.573
it's been proven that we were right,

00:00:56.573 --> 00:00:58.524
that it is a medicine,

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:02.013
that it is helpful to millions of people.

00:01:02.013 --> 00:01:03.976
I think most people are educated now,

00:01:03.976 --> 00:01:05.522
at least more than they were,

00:01:05.522 --> 00:01:07.240
that it's not a killer.

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:10.290
I don't know of anybody who's
ever died from smoking pot.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:12.615
Friend of mine died when
a bale of it fell on him.

00:01:12.615 --> 00:01:13.846
(squelching)

00:01:13.846 --> 00:01:15.554
But, other than that...

00:01:15.554 --> 00:01:16.898
- [Voiceover] So, other than that,

00:01:16.898 --> 00:01:18.615
to him, it's worth fighting for.

00:01:18.615 --> 00:01:21.105
And take his word for it, even at 83,

00:01:21.105 --> 00:01:23.045
the man's lungs are still able to play

00:01:23.045 --> 00:01:25.906
upwards of 100 shows every year.

00:01:25.906 --> 00:01:28.913
- I'm sort of like the canary in the mine.

00:01:28.913 --> 00:01:31.367
I've been here a while and

00:01:31.367 --> 00:01:33.298
whatever it's done for me,

00:01:33.298 --> 00:01:36.285
positive or negative, here it is, you know.

00:01:36.285 --> 00:01:38.664
I think I'm doin' all right.

00:01:38.664 --> 00:01:41.389
I think the water's fine,
you know, come on in.

00:01:41.389 --> 00:01:43.972
(gentle music)

00:01:47.772 --> 00:01:50.022
(chiming)

